# ACCEPTANCE.md G1.2: "a key script that splits, cycles focus, closes and
# maximises tiles reproduces its golden exactly".
#
# Every gesture UI.md section 2 binds, in one script, so a change to any of
# them shows up here as well as in the model tests.

C-x 3        # split side by side
C-x 2        # split the new tile above/below
Tab          # cycle focus forward
Tab
S-Tab        # and back
C-x 0        # close the focused tile
